# Every SwiftPM package under Packages/ builds into its own .build/.
# Ignored by pattern rather than one line per package: a new package is
# added roughly every feature now, and the failure mode of forgetting is
# thousands of build artifacts swept into a commit by an explicit-path
# `git add Packages/<name>/`.
.build/

